:: Bar - invite
<h1 class="ptitle">BAR</h1>
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<actionImage $tmpGirl 'dress_up'>>
</center>

<<include 'NPC info'>>

<br /><br />
<<set _heOrShe = setup.pronounceWhat($tmpGirl)>>
<<set _heOrSheCap = setup.pronounceWhat($tmpGirl, true)>>
<<set _himOrHer = setup.pronounceWho($tmpGirl)>>
<<set _hisOrHer = setup.pronounceWhos($tmpGirl)>>
The stall door stayed shut a while longer. <<=_heOrSheCap>> hooked <<=_hisOrHer>> clothes back into place, pushed <<=_hisOrHer>> hair out of <<=_hisOrHer>> face and checked the result in the cracked mirror over the sinks, making small talk with you the whole time.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
	See? I always pay my debts.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
Somebody rattled the restroom door, swore, and wandered off. Beyond it the bar carried on like nothing had happened.
<br /><br />

<<if ($game.location.guesthouse ?? false) && $guests.length < $guesthouseLimit>>
	<div id="option_invite">
		<<linkreplace 'Ask to move in with you'>>
			<<set _invited = true>>
			<<if $orgasmsBefore === $tmpGirl.orgasms>>
				<<=_heOrSheCap>> snorted at the mirror without turning around.
				<br /><br />
				<<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
					You couldn't even finish what you started in here and now you want me to move in? Buy another round instead.
				<</sayNpc>>
				<br />
			<<elseif setup.percentageChance(50)>>
				<<run $('#option_capture').hide()>>
				<<=_heOrSheCap>> thought about it for exactly as long as it took to fix <<=_hisOrHer>> hair.
				<br /><br />
				<<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
					I've been sleeping four to a room down here since the winter. If you've got walls and a door that locks, I'm in.
				<</sayNpc>>
				<br />
				<<=_heOrSheCap>> followed you out through the bar without looking back at anyone.
				<br /><br />
				<strong><<=$tmpGirl.name>> moved in as guest</strong>
				<<run $guests.push($tmpGirl)>>
				<br />
			<<else>>
				<<sayNpc $tmpGirl>>
					That's sweet. But I've got people down here who'd notice if I stopped showing up. Come find me next time you're buying.
				<</sayNpc>>
				<br />
			<</if>>
			<br />
		<</linkreplace>>
	</div>
<</if>>

<<if ($game.location.basement ?? false) && $slaves.length < $basementLimit>>
	<div id="option_capture">
		<<set _captureLink = 'Capture ' + _himOrHer>>
		<<linkreplace _captureLink>>
			<<set _captured = true>>
			<<if !_invited>>
				<<run $('#option_invite').hide()>>
			<</if>>
			<center>
				<<image 'places/nightclub/wc_enslave.webp'>>
			</center>
			<br /><br />
			You waited until <<=_heOrShe>> turned back to the mirror, then took <<=_himOrHer>> from behind, one arm across the chest and a hand clamped over <<=_hisOrHer>> mouth. <<=_heOrSheCap>> fought hard enough to tear <<=_hisOrHer>> own sleeve against the sink, but the bar was loud and nobody came to see what the noise was.
			<br /><br />
			The service corridor behind the restrooms ran past the kegs to a door nobody watched. By the time the music changed you were already out in the tunnels with <<=_himOrHer>> over your shoulder.
			<br /><br />
			<<run setup.npc.addHistory($tmpGirl, 'captured')>>
			<<statsAdd 'people_captured'>>
			<<set $tmpGirl.capture = false>>
			<<run $slaves.push($tmpGirl)>>
			<strong><<=$tmpGirl.name>> was taken to your basement</strong>
			<br /><br />
		<</linkreplace>>
	</div>
<</if>>

<<link 'Leave'>>
	<<unset $orgasmsBefore>>
	<<unset $tmpGirl>>
	<<if _captured>>
		<<addhours 1>>
		<<goto 'Basement'>>
	<<else>>
		<<goto 'Bar'>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
